      "task": "find white_wall_banner",
      "milestone_id": "find_white_wall_banner",
      "description": "The player must locate the white wall banners on the south exterior wall of the oak plank building. Three banners are placed at spawn-relative coordinates (4,2,5), (6,2,5), and (5,3,5). The center of this banner cluster is (5,2,5). Using position_near_with_facing ensures the player has navigated close enough and is actually looking at the banners, not just passing by. max_distance=16 allows detection from a reasonable viewing range, and facing_tolerance=60 degrees ensures the player is genuinely facing the banners.",
      "rules": [
