      "description": "The player must trade with the shepherd villager inside the building to obtain a blank banner. The villager sells white_banner (a blank banner with no patterns) for 3 emeralds. The player starts with 16 emeralds and 0 banners, so detecting at least 1 white_banner in inventory confirms a successful trade. A white banner qualifies as 'any color blank banner' since it has no patterns applied.",
      "rules": [
